            "title": "美股｜Tom Lee指一大戶被迫清倉 拖累納指科技股急挫",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜Tom Lee指一大戶被迫清倉 拖累納指科技股急挫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜Tom Lee指一大戶被迫清倉 拖累納指科技股急挫</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Fundstrat的Tom Lee認為，美股科技股周五急挫，可能源於一名大型投資者被迫清倉，而非投資者普遍撤離股市。納斯達克綜合指數全月下跌5.3%，為2025年3月以來最差月份。英特爾股價單日大跌28.6%，亞馬遜則錄得424億美元負自由現金流。Lee以等權重標普500指數一度上升為據，指資金仍留在市場，但警告中期選舉前承接力薄弱，股價容易再急跌。</p></div>",
